before:
Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust
enum State { Waiting, Ready(String) }
fn label(state: State) -> String {
    match state {
        State::Waiting => String::from("waiting"),
        State::Ready(text) => text,
    }
}
fn main() { println!("{}", label(State::Ready(String::from("done")))); }
```

